  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is negative or neutral, especially after recent spikes.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoots following strong upward sentiment moves by applying a 10-15% dampening factor.",
    "Increase forecast lag sensitivity for high sentiment volatility — delay peak predictions by 1-2 days.",
    "Apply mean reversion bias: if forecast is >10% above recent 7-day average, reduce by 5-8% unless sentiment strongly bullish.",
    "For sentiment-heavy periods (e.g., >0.5), increase forecast variance to reflect market uncertainty, but cap at ±5% of recent range.",
    "When sentiment is consistently positive but price is trending down, shift forecast midpoint slightly lower to avoid overcorrection."
